# Per-project ceilings, read by כלים/verify-docs.sh
#
# STATUS_MAX is a RATCHET, not a target. It is set to the file's current
# size so the check is live today without blocking work: status.md cannot
# grow from here, and every prune lowers this number.
#
# The target is 60. Lower this line as the file shrinks; the conversion
# session takes it the rest of the way.
#
# A ceiling set to today's reality still enforces something real - it
# enforces "no worse" - and that is available immediately, where "must
# be 60" requires work that has not happened yet.
STATUS_MAX=60
